#: ../../source/users/element/what_is.rst:5
msgid "What is an element?"
msgstr "什么是元件？"

#: ../../source/users/element/what_is.rst:7
msgid "An element is an object which contains information:"
msgstr "元件是一个包含信息的对象："

#: ../../source/users/element/what_is.rst:9
msgid "Graphical representation information, symbol displayed at the schema."
msgstr "图形表示信息，即在原理图中显示的符号。"

#: ../../source/users/element/what_is.rst:10
msgid ""
"Element data such element position in the project, article number, "
"manufacturer, supplier, link to any other element from the project, etc."
msgstr "元件数据，例如元件在项目中的位置、货号、制造商、供应商、与项目中任何其他元件的链接等。"

#: ../../source/users/element/what_is.rst:15
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech thermal circuit breaker element"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 热断路器元件"

#: ../../source/users/element/what_is.rst:17
msgid ""
"An element is an object which function is to reduce the engineering work. "
"Working with elements reduce the time and work necessary for the creation of"
" schemas, Bill Of Materials (BOM) and many other types of reports such "
"terminal lists, I/O lists, etc."
msgstr ""
"元件是一种用于减少工程工作量的对象。使用元件可以减少创建原理图、物料清单（BOM）以及许多其他类型报表（如端子列表、I/O 列表等）所需的时间和精力。"

#: ../../source/users/element/what_is.rst:21
msgid "The element can be classified at different families:"
msgstr "元件可以分为不同的系列："

#: ../../source/users/element/what_is.rst:23
msgid "`Simple`_"
msgstr "`简单 <Simple_>`_"

#: ../../source/users/element/what_is.rst:24
msgid "`Master`_"
msgstr "`主 <Master_>`_"

#: ../../source/users/element/what_is.rst:25
msgid "`Slave`_"
msgstr "`从 <Slave_>`_"

#: ../../source/users/element/what_is.rst:26
msgid "`Reference folio following`_"
msgstr "`后续参考图幅 <Reference folio following_>`_"

#: ../../source/users/element/what_is.rst:27
msgid "`Previous reference folio`_"
msgstr "`前一参考图幅 <Previous reference folio_>`_"

#: ../../source/users/element/what_is.rst:28
msgid "`Terminal block`_"
msgstr "`端子排 <Terminal block_>`_"

#: ../../source/users/element/what_is.rst:30
msgid ""
"The graphical representation information characteristics are the same for "
"all families. The element data properties fields and the possible "
"interlocking options are different between families."
msgstr "所有系列的图形表示信息特征都相同。各系列之间，元件数据的属性字段以及可能的互锁选项有所不同。"
